NOTE ON PROVENANCE
------------------
This project was forked from https://github.com/fthyll/99N, which ships NO
LICENSE file. Absence of a license means the upstream author reserved all
rights, so no open-source grant can honestly be applied to their code.

The MIT grant above covers the work published by COCSTAT (this repository's
own scrapers, CI wiring, rebranding, and UI changes) as far as COCSTAT holds
rights in it. It does not, and cannot, relicense upstream contributions. If
upstream later publishes a license, or you need a clean-room build with no
inherited code, rewrite the frontend and scrapers from scratch — see the
Attribution section of README.md.
